+### Fix I would make
+
+Decide explicitly where withdrawal fees go. If fees should accrue to remaining shareholders as documented, subtract only `netAssets` from the tracked asset base, not `grossAssets`, while carefully handling the final-shareholder case. If fees should go to a treasury instead, withdraw or transfer the fee to that treasury and document the behavior. Add tests for two-user withdrawals and last-user withdrawals.
