+## 4. Deposit fee can be configured above 100%
+
+### What I found
+
+`setDepositFee()` accepts any value. If the owner sets `depositFeeBps` above `10_000`, deposits underflow at `netAmount = amount - fee` and revert. The constructor also accepts an invalid initial fee.
+
+Relevant code: `src/UsdtYieldVault.sol`, lines 126-129:
+
+```solidity
+function setDepositFee(uint256 newFeeBps) external onlyOwner {
+    uint256 previousFeeBps = depositFeeBps;
+    depositFeeBps = newFeeBps;
+    emit DepositFeeUpdated(previousFeeBps, newFeeBps);
+}
+```
+
